{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "e64aa593-ca7d-4bfe-90f6-651d2efb077d",
    "name": "SimpleApi",
    "description": "# SimpleApi\n\nCollection untuk `SimpleApi` (.NET 9 Web API + PostgreSQL, JWT auth, CRUD produk).\n\n## Source Code\n\nhttps://github.com/Asadell/simple-product-api\n\n## Cara pakai\n\n1. Import collection ini dan environment `SimpleApi - Local Dev`, lalu pilih environment.\n2. Isi `base_url` di environment:\n   - **Local**: `http://localhost:5250`\n   - **Production**: `https://product-api.himitpens.net`\n3. Klik **Runner** → **Start run**.\n\n## Format response\n\nSemua endpoint mengembalikan:\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"message\": \"...\",\n  \"data\": { ... }\n}\n```\n\n## Alur Runner (urutan wajib)\n\n1. **Register** — buat user baru (`postman_<timestamp>`), simpan `access_token`\n2. **Login** — login pakai user tadi, refresh `access_token`\n3. **Create Product** — buat produk baru, simpan `product_id`\n4. **Get All Products** — ambil semua produk\n5. **Get Product By Id** — ambil produk yang baru dibuat\n6. **Update Product** — update produk tersebut\n7. **Delete Product** — hapus produk (cleanup)\n\nCollection aman dijalankan berulang kali karena username dan nama produk selalu unik per-run.\n\n## Swagger (Production)\n\nhttps://product-api.himitpens.net/swagger/index.html\n",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "56845145",
    "_collection_link": "https://go.postman.co/collection/56845145-e64aa593-ca7d-4bfe-90f6-651d2efb077d?source=collection_link"
  },
